    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; margin: 0px auto; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px;">In the Return to Seller policy, you have 7 days to initiate return after receiving the item. Generally, you should initiate a return as soon as possible to avoid the seller’s rejection and question validity.</span></div>
