    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; margin: 0px auto; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px;">Return is rejected due to wrong item received</span></div>
    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; margin: 0px auto; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px;">Disputes with a claim of receiving the wrong item would typically result in a return. Pack the item securely and keep track of the return shipping using the tracking details provided.</span></div>
